.TH TARBZIP 1 "DTar Manual"
.SH NAME
tarbzip \- create a bzip2-compressed tarball
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tarbzip
<path> [output]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates a bzip2-compressed tar archive from the specified file or directory.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I path
The file or directory to archive.
.TP
.I output
(Optional) Output tarball file name.